ked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Tray just off today stopped using its internal tools. So it can not edit files anymore but instead allways prints any edits into the chat and requires me to apply manually. Builder mode is not being entered anymore.\nI restarted the machine and checked for updates to ide or extensions... to check if it might be a temporary thing. But all tries failed, Trae currently is unusable for agenting coding.\nTrae can still use all additional mcp tools.. but none of the internal ones. So currently it is nothing more than a chatbot and not an agentic coder.\nAs there were no updates to trae or any extension, I assume it might be a handling issue on the server side.\n\nPlease address this issue to get trae back to working condition\n\nEdit... I tested on various machines.. and it seems that it only does not work on machines with an intel arc and their newest drivers!? What is really weired....","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3210535837","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398#issuecomment-3210535837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398","id":3210535837,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6_XOOd","user":{"login":"duguaosnowqrl","id":88035734,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDM1NzM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88035734?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl","html_url":"https://github.com/duguaosnowqrl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duguaosnowqrl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T13:08:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T13:08:08Z","body":"I ran into a similar problem. It was working fine, but after running a command it stopped working and kept reporting timeouts. Then I restarted Trae, and it prompted me to install a new version. After re-entering, Trae became completely useless — like an idiot — and didn't work at all. It feels lazier and dumber, and the quality of the code it generates has also declined: it even produced a Java class written entirely in lowercase letters, what a stupid mistake.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3210535837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3211216183","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398#issuecomment-3211216183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398","id":3211216183,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6_Z0U3","user":{"login":"votanxerxes","id":3658144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTgxNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3658144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes","html_url":"https://github.com/votanxerxes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votanxerxes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T16:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T16:00:53Z","body":"Here is the recent chat I had with trae.. after a new installation, freshly downloaded and launching with elevated rights, just to make sure. Here is what Trae tells me:\n\nI still have access to the same tools as before:\n\n## Current Available Tools:\n- todo_write - Task management\n- search_codebase - Code searching\n- search_by_regex - Pattern matching\n- view_files - File reading (up to 3 files, 250 lines each)\n- list_dir - Directory listing\n- check_command_status - Command status checking\n- open_preview - Preview URLs\n- web_search - Internet search\n- response_to_user - Response tool\n\n## Still Missing:\n- File creation/editing tools (create_file, edit_file, write_file)\n- Terminal execution tools (execute_command, run_terminal)\n## Admin Status Test:\nRunning as admin hasn't unlocked the missing file system and terminal tools that should be available according to the Builder agent interface. The tool schema remains the same.\n\n## Current Limitation:\nI can provide you with the complete Pong game code, but I cannot:\n\n1. 1.\n   Create the main.c file directly\n2. 2.\n   Create the build.zig file\n3. 3.\n   Execute zig build commands\n4. 4.\n   Test the compilation\n## Recommendation:\nSince the enhanced MCP tools I provided earlier would solve this issue, you could either:\n\n1. 1.\n   Install those custom MCPs I designed\n2. 2.\n   Manually create files from the code I provide\n3. 3.\n   Check if there's a different way to enable the missing tools in Trae IDE\nWould you like me to provide the complete Pong game code that you can manually create as files, or should we focus on getting the file system tools working first?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3211216183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3964641990","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398#issuecomment-3964641990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1398","id":3964641990,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7sT6LG","user":{"login":"SharePointRadi","id":5693618,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2OTM2MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5693618?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi","html_url":"https://github.com/SharePointRadi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SharePointRadi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026